        "en": "B0-B4 read/write, B5 reserved. B6-B8 (read) run command source: 0 keypad, 1 Fx/Rx-1, 2 Fx/Rx-2, 3 built-in 485, 4 comm option, 5 time event. B9-B14 (read) frequency source: 0 keypad freq, 2-8 terminal multi-step, 17 up, 18 down, 19 steady, 22 V1, 24 V2, 25 I2, 26 pulse, 27 built-in 485, 28 comm option, 30 jog, 31 PID. B15 reserved."
